        "rich_text": "<p>Brownies-</p><p><strong>Triple chocolate- Butter</strong>, <strong>Eggs</strong>, Sugar, Cocoa powder, <strong>Wheat </strong>Flour (<strong>Wheat<br/></strong>Flour, Calcium Carbonate, Iron, Niacin, Thiamin), Luxury Belgian dark<br/>Chocolate 62% (Sugar, Cocoa butter, Cocoa mass, Emulsifier (E-322 Sunflower<br/>Lecithin) and Natural Vanilla), White Chocolate (Sugar, Cocoa Butter, Whole<br/><strong>Milk </strong>powder, Emulsifier (E-322 Sunflower <strong>Soya<br/></strong>Lecithins) and natural<br/>Flavour), Luxury Belgian milk<br/>chocolate (Sugar, Cocoa Butter, Whole <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>MILK<br/></strong></span>Powder, Cocoa Mass, Dextrose, <strong>Butter</strong>, Emulsifier (E-322<br/>Sunflower Lecithin), and Natural Flavour).</p><p> </p><p>For allergens, including cereals containing gluten, see ingredients in <strong>bold</strong>. May also contain <strong>peanuts </strong>and other <strong>nuts</strong>.</p><p>Please be aware we use <strong>gluten</strong>, <strong>dairy</strong>, <strong>eggs</strong>, <strong>soya</strong>, <strong>nuts </strong>and <strong>peanuts </strong>in our bakery. Suitable for vegetarians and does not contain alcohol.</p><p><strong>Pistachio - Butter</strong>, <strong>Eggs</strong>, Sugar, Cocoa powder, <strong>Wheat </strong>Flour (<strong>Wheat<br/></strong>Flour, Calcium Carbonate, Iron, Niacin, Thiamin), Luxury Belgian dark<br/>Chocolate 62% (Sugar, Cocoa butter, Cocoa mass, Emulsifier (E-322 Sunflower<br/>Lecithin) and Natural Vanilla), White Chocolate (Sugar, Cocoa Butter, Whole<br/><strong>Milk </strong>powder, Emulsifier (E-322 Sunflower <strong>Soya<br/></strong>Lecithins) and natural<br/>Flavour), Luxury Belgian milk<br/>chocolate (Sugar, Cocoa Butter, Whole <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>MILK<br/></strong></span>Powder, Cocoa Mass, Dextrose, <strong>Butter</strong>, Emulsifier (E-322<br/>Sunflower Lecithin), and Natural Flavour). <strong>Pistachio </strong>spread Sugar,<br/>Vegetable Oils and Fats (Karite, Sunflower), <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>PISTCAHIO </strong></span>Paste, <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>LACTOSE</strong></span>,<br/>Whey <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>MILK</strong></span><strong> </strong>Powder, Skimmed <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>MILK</strong></span><strong> </strong>Powder, Emulsifier<br/>(E-322 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">SOYA</span> Lecithin, E-471), Spirulina Extracte and Natural Colour<br/>(Lutein).</p><h1>Pistachios.</h1><p>For allergens, including cereals containing gluten, see ingredients in <strong>bold</strong>. May also contain <strong>peanuts </strong>and other <strong>nuts</strong>.</p><p>Please be aware we use <strong>gluten</strong>, <strong>dairy</strong>, <strong>eggs</strong>, <strong>soya</strong>, <strong>nuts </strong>and <strong>peanuts </strong>in our bakery. Suitable for vegetarians and does not contain alcohol.</p><p><strong>Cookie dough- Butter</strong>, <strong>Eggs</strong>, Sugar,<br/>Cocoa powder, <strong>Wheat </strong>Flour (<strong>Wheat </strong>Flour, Calcium Carbonate, Iron,<br/>Niacin, Thiamin), Luxury Belgian dark Chocolate 62% (Sugar, Cocoa butter,<br/>Cocoa mass, Emulsifier (E-322 Sunflower Lecithin) and Natural Vanilla), White Chocolate (Sugar, Cocoa Butter, Whole <strong>Milk </strong>powder,<br/>Emulsifier (E-322 Sunflower <strong>Soya </strong>Lecithins) and natural Flavour), Luxury<br/>Belgian milk chocolate (Sugar, Cocoa Butter, Whole <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>MILK </strong></span>Powder, Cocoa Mass,<br/>Dextrose, <strong>Butter</strong>, Emulsifier (E-322 Sunflower Lecithin), and Natural<br/>Flavour). Cookie dough - <strong>Butter</strong>, <strong>Eggs</strong>, granulated sugar, Brown sugar,<br/>Cornflour, <strong>Wheat </strong>Flour (<strong>Wheat </strong>Flour, Calcium Carbonate, Iron,<br/>Niacin, Thiamin), Baking powder (raising agent (E 450 (Diphosphates), E 500<br/>(Sodium Carbonates), Maize Starch), Vanilla essence (Water, Monopropylene<br/>Glycol, Colour (Plain Caramel), Flavourings), White Chocolate (Sugar, Cocoa Butter,<br/>Whole <strong>Milk </strong>powder, Emulsifier (E-322 Sunflower <strong>Soya </strong>Lecithins)<br/>and natural Flavour), Luxury Belgian milk chocolate (Sugar, Cocoa Butter, Whole<br/><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>MILK </strong></span>Powder, Cocoa Mass, Dextrose, <strong>Butter</strong>, Emulsifier<br/>(E-322 Sunflower Lecithin), and Natural Flavour). Choc chip cookies - <strong>Wheat </strong>Flour (contains Calcium<br/>Carbonate, Iron, Nicotinamide, Thiamin), Chocolate Chips (22%) (Sugar, Cocoa<br/>Mass, Vegetable Fats (Palm Oil, Sal Fat, Shea Oil), Emulsifier (<strong>Soya </strong>Lecithins,<br/>Ammonium Phosphatides, Polyglycerol Polyricinoleate), Cocoa Butter,<br/>Flavouring), Palm Oil, Sugar, Whey Powder (<strong>Milk</strong>), Partially Inverted<br/>Sugar Syrup, Raising Agents (Sodium Bicarbonate, Ammonium Bicarbonate), Salt, Flavouring</p><p>For allergens, including cereals<br/>containing gluten, see ingredients in bold. May also contain<br/>peanuts and other nuts.</p><p>Please be aware we use <strong>gluten, dairy, eggs, soya, nuts </strong>and<br/><strong>peanuts </strong>in our bakery.<br/>Suitable for vegetarians and does not contain alcohol.</p><p><strong>Biscoff- Butter</strong>, <strong>Eggs</strong>, Sugar, Cocoa powder, <strong>Wheat </strong>Flour (<strong>Wheat<br/></strong>Flour, Calcium Carbonate, Iron, Niacin, Thiamin), Luxury Belgian dark<br/>Chocolate 62% (Sugar, Cocoa butter, Cocoa mass, Emulsifier (E-322 Sunflower<br/>Lecithin) and Natural Vanilla), White Chocolate (Sugar, Cocoa Butter, Whole <strong>Milk<br/></strong>powder, Emulsifier (E-322<br/>Sunflower <strong>Soya </strong>Lecithins) and natural Flavour), Luxury Belgian milk<br/>chocolate (Sugar, Cocoa Butter, Whole <span style=\"text-decoration:u